Code source:
  Source: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers
          (models/segformer/{configuration_segformer.py, modeling_segformer.py})
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Copyright: 2021 NVIDIA and The HuggingFace Inc. team.
  LibreSegformer's encoder (libreyolo/models/segformer/nn.py: MiT overlap
  patch embeddings, efficient self-attention with spatial reduction, Mix-FFN)
  and all-MLP decode head are a native PyTorch port of this Apache-2.0
  reference implementation. There is no runtime dependency on the
  transformers package.

Weights:
  LibreYOLO ships no pretrained SegFormer weights for any size (b0-b5). There
  is no conversion script and no auto-download URL — the upstream
  nvidia/segformer-b0..b5-* checkpoints are under a non-permissive,
  non-commercial NVIDIA license and are never mirrored or redistributed.
  Train from scratch on your own semantic dataset via
  LibreSegformer(...).train(...).
